  m_Name: Dialogue_Ngay1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  dialogueID: dialogue_day1
  description: "M\xF4 t\u1EA3 ng\u1EAFn v\u1EC1 \u0111o\u1EA1n tho\u1EA1i"
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "T\xF4i \u0111\xE3 v\u1EBD s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 khu v\u1EF1c ph\xEDa \u0110\xF4ng.
      C\xF3 nhi\u1EC1u t\xE0i nguy\xEAn \u1EDF \u0111\xF3."
    emotion: 
  - speaker: 2
    text: "T\xF4i s\u1EBD \u0111i th\xE1m th\xEDnh. C\u1EA7n bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBch
      \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u."
    emotion: 
  - speaker: 0
    text: "C\u1EA9n th\u1EADn. \u0110\xEAm nay ch\xFAng ta \u1EDF l\u1EA1i \u0111\xE2y
      \u2014 x\xE2y tr\u1EA1i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
    emotion: 
  - speaker: 3
    text: "Minh... c\u1EADu b\u1ECB x\u01B0\u1EDBc \u1EDF tay r\u1ED3i. \u0110\u1EC3
      t\xF4i b\u0103ng b\xF3 cho."
    emotion: 
  onDialogueEnd:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
